%% Proposed architecture, not implemented. Domain values are server-owned.
flowchart TB
  U[User question and explicit visual request] --> C[Trusted request context and private memory]
  C --> P[Python bounded analysis chain]
  P --> E[Effective data and deterministic tools]
  E --> RS[Immutable ResultSets and EvidenceRefs]
  RS --> G[Gemma narrative and component selection]
  G --> V[Parse and validate bounded view plan]
  V --> J{Valid and grounded?}
  J -->|one formatting repair| G
  J -->|still invalid| F[Server-composed factual fallback]
  J -->|yes| A[AnswerEnvelope assembler]
  RS --> A
  F --> A
  A --> S[Python AG-UI events and SSE encoder]
  S --> AC[Browser AG-UI HttpAgent client]
  AC --> ST[Run-scoped reducer and saved snapshot]
  ST --> R[Allowlisted React renderer]
  R --> N[Inline narrative and citations]
  R --> D[One message with 4 or 5 panels]
  D --> B[Status card and table]
  D --> H[Line or bar chart and heatmap]
  D --> M[Map or cited diagram]
  K[Shared correction commit] --> REV[New knowledge revision and invalidation]
  REV --> P
  REV --> ST
